<title>USA: Splash completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Splash completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Splash Technology Holdings Inc on Thursday said it has completed its acquisition of privately-held Quintar Co, a maker and marketer of embedded controllers for computer printers and servers.</p>
<p>Splash paid roughly $11.5 million dollars in cash for the company and agrred to pay an additional $3.2 million depending on whether Quintar can achieve revenue and profit goals.</p>
<p>Shares of Splash, a maker of computer color servers, were off 1-5/8 at 24-7/8 near the end of trading.</p>
